OL,3,GNEWSA'Big eyes looking at us' - Chimney
OL,4,Asweep rescues owl trapped in stove pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chimney sweep has rescued a tawny owl
OL,7,Fthat got itself into a flap after
OL,8,Fbecoming trapped inside a stove.
OL,10,FJohn Soutar found the bird wedged in a
OL,11,Fpipe at the back of the appliance after
OL,12,Fhe was called to a house in Noranside,
OL,13,FAngus.
OL,15,F"Luckily with a bit of persuasion, we
OL,16,Fmanaged to get him free from the pipe
OL,17,Funharmed," he said.
OL,19,FAfter cleaning the bird off with a
OL,20,Ftowel, Soutar then released the owl in
OL,21,Fthe garden of the property.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
